Albion Market Analyzer Client (Coldtouch build)
================================================

This software is a derivative work built on top of the Albion Data Client,
an open-source packet-capture client for Albion Online.

  Upstream project : Albion Data Client
  Upstream source  : https://github.com/ao-data/albiondata-client
  Upstream license : MIT (see LICENSE)
  Upstream copyright: Copyright (c) 2017 The Albion Data Project

The upstream project provides the foundational packet-capture and Photon
protocol-decoding framework (including the vendored photon-spectator library),
the operation/event routing layer, and the market-data upload infrastructure.

Substantial additions in this build are by Coldtouch, including but not limited
to: chest/vault capture, the loot logger and accountability pipeline, the combat
meter, the player-trade tracker, the VPS relay, OAuth device-flow authentication,
and WinDivert/VPN capture support.

